// `std.reals`: the home of the exact reals' host interface, `std.reals.Eff`,
// whose operations admit the canonical bytes of a plan, enclose its root, and
// decide an open root by a resumable machine.
// A source names the interface where it imports this module,
// `import std.reals;`, and nowhere else. The interface is native, so no
// declaration here states it.
